  ob name text learn focus text to name learning refine request be plus do
  ob text "\n\nDRAFT CARD:\n" to name learning refine request be plus do
  ob name text learn card text to name learning refine request be plus do

  su name teaching raw stage ob name text learning refine request fromtext name learning refine prompt for name mind to name text teaching raw by num 0 atmost num 1800 be write do
  ob text "node command/extract_learn_pipeline_result.mjs" fromtext name teaching raw to name text teaching out be command do
  ob text "node command/normalize_learn_card.mjs" fromtext name teaching out to name text teaching out be command do
  ob text "node command/validate_learn_card.mjs" fromtext name teaching out to name text learning card valid be command do
