su name learn from text source with text learning focus to name text teaching out be ceremony def
  ob text of with of this be equally from text "" then
  ob bool lie fromtext text "learning focus defective: give a non-empty learning focus" be guarantee do
  su name teaching card stage from text of from of this with text of with of this to name text teaching card be learn extract card do
  su name teaching stage from text of ob of teaching card with text of with of this to name text teaching out be learn refine card do
  su name learning source support verify stage from text of from of this with text of ob of teaching out to name text learning source support score be learning source support do
  ob text of ob of learning source support score from num 0 to num 1 become name num to name num learning source support score num be cast do
  ob text "learning source support defective: score=" to name text learning source support defect be text do
  ob text of ob of learning source support score to name learning source support defect be plus do
